.MARINE...
(Today through Thursday)
Issued at 914 AM PDT Sat Aug 29 2026

Northwest winds remain fresh with strong to near gale force gusts
today into Sunday night. In response, wind driven seas build to
rough this afternoon and steadily subside to moderate through next
week. A long period southerly swell also peaks today around 17 to
18 seconds and gradually diminishes by Sunday night.

